      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e implementation of the IStreamIn|Out may override and implement it.\n\nPer experience, this change is not working.\n\nSince the dump is called on `IStreamCommon` in `StreamHalAidl`, which should be implemeted by `StreamCommonDelegator` who inherited `BnStreamCommon`, and the `StreamCommonDelegator` is wraped as a variable inside `StreamCommonImpl ` which means it will be wraped in `StreamIn|Out`, then add dump into `StreamCommonInterface` seems inevitable.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libaudiohal/impl/StreamHalAidl.h;drc\u003d90a4306d7e6b292c2797e601eb7de282f643efad;l\u003d346\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/media/libaudiohal/impl/StreamHalAidl.cpp;drc\u003d98797c2e6739910998c05a4ec0bc835690dcc76f;l\u003d281\n\nFurthermore, since `IStreamIn|Out` are not aidl service, we also want to dump `StreamIn|Out` by dumping `Module` who can access them by `Streams`.",
